<title>USA: Crocker Realty Trust announces dividend.</title>
<headline>Crocker Realty Trust announces dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crocker Realty Trust Inc said on Tuesday its board of directors announced a dividend payment to shareholders from July 1 through September 20, 1996.</p>
<p>The dividend of $0.1337 per share for shareholders of record as of September 20 is payable September 24 and represents a pro-rata portion of the company's policy of paying quarterly dividends of $0.15.</p>
</text>
